=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyT3oIs0zXcMJMCN124ay_4f46IvvHgkNtrE7BozrfgGA&oe=69C51853"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "iconA1.png", "id": "1170597108419919", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619747_1170597115086585_5395268478651940866_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lDmnqd6WCE4Q7kNvwHeEnAP&_nc_oc=Adp0N5gAIZWr1FYo6FbI1Si5aciTMJhMTN5SYtZgCRTvHc2PJoBFJF40qsDJ_ioJ9Kc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzS4Q1Xn-HhKf97g4MuURQAn5UfcTEhPtQcO8bMY3RGcA&oe=69C53A10"}, "display_name": "I Am Mouse : Adventure Simulator", "keywords": ["iam", "mouse", "simulator", "adventure", "iammouse"], "long_description": "**Welcome to I Am Mouse: Your Tiny Adventure Awaits!**\n\n**Pick Your Adventure, Little Mouse!**\n\nChoose from the House, Office, or Space and dive straight into exciting challenges and surprises! Each world has a new adventure waiting for you!\n\n{1159542949524800}\n\n**Cheese Chase: Snatch the Snack!**\nOutsmart RC cars and drones to collect the most cheese in this thrilling, high-speed adventure!\n\n\n{745547554751341}\n\n**Aliens on the Loose? Send in the Mouse!**\n\nJoin the mouse on a galactic adventure, armed with a space gun to blast those pesky aliens!\n\n\n\n{10042326845876356}", "short_description": "Experience life as a tiny explorer in I Am Mouse: Adventure Simulator, a fun and family-friendly VR adventure! Scurry through a house, office, and space station as a curious mouse. Collect cheese, solve small tasks, and discover the world from a whole new perspective. Three interactive maps, tons of surprises, and all the charm of a whiskered hero\u2014your squeaky VR journey starts now!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tretastudios.com/vrprivacypolicy.php", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "TretaStudios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://tretastudios.